abstract: "A finite algebra over epistemic states, implemented as a reproducible visual notation system with enforced invariants. Four-state classification (NORMATIVE / NON-NORMATIVE / CRITICAL / METACOGNITIVE) realised as the Klein four-group V4, encoded redundantly through color, orientation, and textual label. v2.0.0 refines the METACOGNITIVE phrasing to 'The observer audits the frame' (deprecating 'This audits the standard'), makes the accessibility rule (color is not the only carrier) normative, adds an explanation document, and ships a single-command reproducible PDF pipeline. The V4 algebra and sigma_h assignment are unchanged from v1.2.0."
keywords:
  - visual epistemic notation
  - classification system
  - Klein four-group
  - V4
  - DNS Tool
  - documentation
  - epistemology
  - metacognition
  - accessibility
